OL,3,GNEWSASchools to break up early ahead of
OL,4,AIsland Games
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchools will break up for the summer
OL,7,Fholidays a week earlier than usual in
OL,8,F2029 as the Isle of Man hosts the
OL,9,FIsland Games.
OL,11,FThe Department of Education, Sport and
OL,12,FCulture (Desc) confirmed schools would
OL,13,Fbreak up on Friday 13 July ahead of the
OL,14,Fstart of the multi-sport competition
OL,15,Fthe following day.
OL,17,FHowever, it said the number of days in
OL,18,Fthe academic year would remain
OL,19,Funchanged at 188 days overall.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,448,445,260,140,0,100
