OL,3,GNEWSASchools to break up early ahead of
OL,4,AIsland Games
OL,5,
OL,6,FDesc Minister Sarah Maltby said it was
OL,7,Fa "once-in-a-generation chance" for
OL,8,Fschool children to watch the games on
OL,9,Fhome soil.
